Depends on what she means by "edge," but the best simple answers I have are:

1. Probably just more of the same;
2. Nobody knows for sure;
3. There isn't really an edge, there's just an edge to what we can see from here.

(These are all true, it's not one or the other.)

"Paving over every paradise is just the side effect of building the universal parking lot, where nothing bad can ever happen again."

